id: ops-bounded-input
title: Refuse unsafe diagnostic and artifact inputs before reading
description: Reject non-regular and oversized package inputs with bounded reads and typed remedies; include plan input and scope resolution in the execution deadline.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-ops#195"
created_at: "2026-10-24T05:12:38.041Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T05:53:47.561Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-24T05:12:43.234Z",codex-agent,"Auditing every direct package reader. Use one bounded regular-file reader with nonblocking open and descriptor validation, preserve domain refusal categories and remedies, charge diagnostic input and scope resolution to the shared deadline. Regressions use real special files and externally bounded subprocesses in a non-Git fixture."
  "2026-10-24T05:23:31.840Z",codex-agent,"Implemented one regular-file input primitive across all direct readers, including backend config, policy, evidence versions, workflow files, source scanners, coverage artifacts and plan JSON. Real FIFO without a writer, Unix socket, device, directory and oversized inputs return typed remedies; descriptor race and growth controls pass. Non-Git tracker and empty PATH exercise eight input surfaces. Local reader suites: 130 passed, zero failed/skipped."
  "2026-10-24T05:23:33.492Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof: replaced only readDiagnosticPlan with its origin/main implementation and restored its open import. node --test --test-name-pattern=\"all artifact readers refuse\" test/regular-input.test.ts failed 1/1 with ETIMEDOUT at the 5000 ms subprocess ceiling on the real writerless FIFO. Restored the fixed function immediately; no tracker bytes were changed by the regression."
  "2026-10-24T05:25:15.899Z",codex-agent,"Focused core checks: 76 tests passed with statements/branches/functions/lines all 100% across regular-input, diagnostic-plans, release-completeness and release-repair. Added a CLI-level injected-clock regression proving plan file time exhausts the shared deadline with zero launches. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, docstring and zero-duplication gates pass locally. Full npm and Bun release gates are reserved for CI because the shared host is saturated."
  "2026-10-24T05:30:01.642Z",codex-agent,"CI run 40066282167 measured 100% statements/branches/functions/lines across all authored source, but three legacy launcher/release-caller assertions still expected raw ENOENT. Updating those assertions to the intentionally sanitized invalid_input + unreadable contract. No threshold or runtime check is weakened. Both Linux matrix jobs failed on these same three assertions before Bun could run."
  "2026-10-24T05:30:31.331Z",codex-agent,"Updated missing-file expectations now pass in the focused launcher/release-caller suite: 14/14, zero failed/skipped. The linked pm test run also passes 14/14. Input refusals retain their code and unreadable reason rather than exposing operating-system diagnostics."
  "2026-10-24T05:36:40.058Z",codex-agent,"Full CI passed on code head 005fce5c08835b255ec60fbe2c879f8c72767703: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/actions/runs/40066539717 . Node 22 and 26 each passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check: 1432 tests, 1430 passed, 0 failed, 2 configured real-data skips, 0 canceled/TODO; 100% statements/branches/functions/lines across 35 source files. Both Windows packed npm/native Bun consumer jobs passed. Strict project health passed. Releasing claim for orchestrator verification; item stays in_progress."
  "2026-10-24T05:47:02.038Z",codex-agent,"PR 196 blocking review: audit all package subprocess captures, stream tar members through file descriptors and hash bounded chunks, add shared typed output-limit refusals with remedies, and prove real 5 MiB matching and mismatching tarballs plus a source-only revert. Remote branch is current and includes main. Keep thresholds unchanged; targeted tests, typecheck and lint locally, npm and Bun full gates in CI."
  "2026-10-24T05:51:20.155Z",codex-agent,"Capture audit complete across runtime modules, gate scripts, template and package launchers. All captures share a finite-limit adapter; inherited stdio launchers have no capture. Tarball integrity and descriptor-streamed member files use 64 KiB hashing chunks. Real npm pack/tar fixtures cover matching and mismatching 5 MiB members. Overflow returns sanitized output_limit with remedy; release caller does not fall back to bundled approval after overflow, and diagnostics preserve an output_limit receipt. Added a capture-inventory guard and documented transports."
  "2026-10-24T05:52:20.635Z",codex-agent,"Source-only behavioural revert proof: restored the old tar-member capture and bypassed only the new exec/spawn capture controls, leaving tests and all other behavior unchanged. Rebuilt, then ran node --test --test-name-pattern=\"real tarball|real exec and spawn\" test/release-repair.test.ts test/subprocess.test.ts: 3 tests, 0 passed, 3 failed. Matching 5 MiB tar failed with spawnSync tar ENOBUFS; mismatching 5 MiB tar failed with ENOBUFS instead of the content-mismatch refusal; capture overflow lacked CaptureRefusal. Restored both source files byte-for-byte and rebuilt; identical command: 3 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped. Broader targeted command passed 54/54 before revert."
  "2026-10-24T05:53:15.301Z",codex-agent,"Validation: node --test test/subprocess.test.ts test/release-repair.test.ts test/release-caller.test.ts test/diagnostic-plans.test.ts passed 54/54, zero failures/skips. Focused c8 coverage of subprocess.ts, release-repair.ts, release-caller.ts and diagnostic-plans.ts is 100% statements, branches, functions and lines. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run lint, npm run duplication and npm run docstring passed; duplication remains 0% at unchanged thresholds. pm test ops-bounded-input --run --progress passed all 3 linked commands with no failures; result persistence is disabled by project policy, so this comment retains the receipt. Full npm/Bun release evidence will come from CI."
  "2026-10-24T05:53:47.561Z",codex-agent,"All 3 linked commands passed: 20/20, 15/15 and 54/54. Changelog generation and check passed. Strict tracker health passes with isolated HOME and Git configuration (only advisory telemetry queue pending). Inherited host health reports installed extension/host pm-cli version skew (pinned 2026.10.20 versus host 2026.10.24); dependency pins and telemetry configuration remain unchanged. Claim released; item stays in progress for orchestrator verification."
